# RSVP Backend API Documentation

## Base URL
```
http://localhost:8080/api
```

---

## 1️⃣ Event Management APIs

### Create Event
```http
POST /api/events
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: admin

{
  "name": "Wedding Reception",
  "description": "Join us for our wedding celebration",
  "venue": "Grand Hotel, Mumbai",
  "eventDateTime": "2025-12-25T18:00:00",
  "rsvpDeadline": "2025-12-20T23:59:59",
  "bannerImage": "https://example.com/banner.jpg",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}
```

**Response (201)**
```json
{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "Wedding Reception",
  "description": "Join us for our wedding celebration",
  "venue": "Grand Hotel, Mumbai",
  "eventDateTime": "2025-12-25T18:00:00",
  "rsvpDeadline": "2025-12-20T23:59:59",
  "bannerImage": "https://example.com/banner.jpg",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "createdAt": "2025-12-17T10:00:00",
  "updatedAt": "2025-12-17T10:00:00",
  "createdBy": "admin"
}
```

### Update Event
```http
PUT /api/events/{id}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Event Name",
  "status": "CLOSED"
}
```

### Get Event
```http
GET /api/events/{id}
```

### Get All Events
```http
GET /api/events
GET /api/events?status=ACTIVE
```

### Close Event
```http
PUT /api/events/{id}/close
```

### Delete Event
```http
DELETE /api/events/{id}
```

