## Status Enums

### Event Status
- `ACTIVE` - Event is open for RSVPs
- `CLOSED` - Event is closed

### RSVP Status
- `YES` - Guest confirmed attendance
- `NO` - Guest declined

### Invite Type
- `INDIVIDUAL` - Single person invitation
- `GROUP` - Group invitation

### WhatsApp Sent Status
- `SENT` - Message sent successfully
- `FAILED` - Message failed to send
- `PENDING` - Message pending

### Sync Status
- `PENDING_SYNC` - Awaiting sync from fast store
- `SYNCED` - Successfully synced
- `FAILED` - Sync failed

